    "detailed_description": "<h1>FEATURE LIST</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Unknown and\u00a0Fight for Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/065078ee30041f3ffaba7a0a1d6ecc5a.poster.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/065078ee30041f3ffaba7a0a1d6ecc5a.webm?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/065078ee30041f3ffaba7a0a1d6ecc5a.mp4?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into ancient dungeons, unearth lost secrets, and navigate treacherous ruins.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monstrous foes in strategic, turn-based combat. Wield powerful weapons, master arcane spells, and equip rare artifacts. Your stats, skills, and inventory will determine your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft, inventory, character stats - old school RPG experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/c20613879bb5b6f529013805577b41f9.poster.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/c20613879bb5b6f529013805577b41f9.webm?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/c20613879bb5b6f529013805577b41f9.mp4?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>More than 200 gear items and 5 magic elements to make you own build..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive story and deeply build world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/c826fee4bbfdfb94e9c70ad96d1de1db.poster.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/c826fee4bbfdfb94e9c70ad96d1de1db.webm?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/c826fee4bbfdfb94e9c70ad96d1de1db.mp4?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Book of Outcasts</i>\u00a0has more than 50 characters and it's world carefully created and written in encyclopedia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Animated 2D art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/6865409e542677ceaad271f6a3a0b7dd.poster.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/6865409e542677ceaad271f6a3a0b7dd.webm?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/6865409e542677ceaad271f6a3a0b7dd.mp4?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/f9624d2f81a24edf8efcc47799bc1a2f.poster.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/f9624d2f81a24edf8efcc47799bc1a2f.webm?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/f9624d2f81a24edf8efcc47799bc1a2f.mp4?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully drawn 2D art for better immersion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sensual Animated Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/5ba0f89625228fcd1247d39a69cd0fb3.poster.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/5ba0f89625228fcd1247d39a69cd0fb3.webm?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/5ba0f89625228fcd1247d39a69cd0fb3.mp4?t=1755326559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intimate moments with fully animated, drawn sex scenes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All in all</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 7 hours of gameplay.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Book of Outcasts is a sequel to TKS: Conussia and The Book of Bondmaids, taking place 100 years after the events of those games. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/b476ebc67ee586640276d1702fd39dc2.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The icy lands of Conussia have not changed much in the last hundred years \u2013 the winters are still biting and cold, the people still stoic and proud and the lands still beautiful and haunting, but the scars left after the Lich King overthrew the Romanzak royal family all those years ago remain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/e6a5278d491513797337af7d5185781d.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disgraced former soldier, you are recruited into the Tsarina\u2019s secretive Sparrows to investigate and hunt down the rogue mage Carpenter, taking a position as a Constable in a remote village far from civilisation but built on the ruins of an ancient and terrible city. Quickly, however, you become embroiled in the workings of the mysterious order of undying wizards known as the Outcasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/a1502bff20742b72e2c98f3015916d5c.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Book of Outcasts is an RPG dungeon crawler, horror and management sim where you play as either a male or female character, travelling through icy forests and sweltering hot jungles tracking down the mysterious mage in the wooden mask, who may hold the secrets of your own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/549f3ff09c6183105c1c991b3d2d1159.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will need to gain allies and equipment if they are to survive, as well as ensure the village will survive the winter. The snows are bitterly cold in Kemskaya Volost, but the fires and the beds are warm\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/a50b7a6dbc21d0f2dfaf3fe435974804.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The Book of Outcasts is strictly 18+ due to mature themes and extremely strong sexual content, including depiction of consensual acts, BDSM, gay/ lesbian sex, graphic descriptions of torture, use of drugs and alcohol, group sex, murder, strong language and swearing, full male and female nudity, and prostitution).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/03bd50a85dccbadffeae0718f11c1b3b.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Book of Outcasts is a sequel to TKS: Conussia and The Book of Bondmaids, taking place 100 years after the events of those games. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/b476ebc67ee586640276d1702fd39dc2.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The icy lands of Conussia have not changed much in the last hundred years \u2013 the winters are still biting and cold, the people still stoic and proud and the lands still beautiful and haunting, but the scars left after the Lich King overthrew the Romanzak royal family all those years ago remain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/e6a5278d491513797337af7d5185781d.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disgraced former soldier, you are recruited into the Tsarina\u2019s secretive Sparrows to investigate and hunt down the rogue mage Carpenter, taking a position as a Constable in a remote village far from civilisation but built on the ruins of an ancient and terrible city. Quickly, however, you become embroiled in the workings of the mysterious order of undying wizards known as the Outcasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/a1502bff20742b72e2c98f3015916d5c.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Book of Outcasts is an RPG dungeon crawler, horror and management sim where you play as either a male or female character, travelling through icy forests and sweltering hot jungles tracking down the mysterious mage in the wooden mask, who may hold the secrets of your own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/549f3ff09c6183105c1c991b3d2d1159.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will need to gain allies and equipment if they are to survive, as well as ensure the village will survive the winter. The snows are bitterly cold in Kemskaya Volost, but the fires and the beds are warm\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/a50b7a6dbc21d0f2dfaf3fe435974804.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The Book of Outcasts is strictly 18+ due to mature themes and extremely strong sexual content, including depiction of consensual acts, BDSM, gay/ lesbian sex, graphic descriptions of torture, use of drugs and alcohol, group sex, murder, strong language and swearing, full male and female nudity, and prostitution).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849180/extras/03bd50a85dccbadffeae0718f11c1b3b.avif?t=1755326559\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
